# Technical Analysis

The default staff credentials vulnerability was confirmed during the assessment. The flag was retrieved from the internal staff portal which displays sensitive operational and financial data including the daily permit-issuance signing key. The vulnerability stems from the failure to implement credential rotation and change default passwords following the 2018 platform redesign. The system appears to contain a signing key mechanism that may be critical for permit issuance security.

